<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ meta.title }}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gothic+A1:wght@500;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: #EEF0F5; color: #0A1547;
         font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: #1428A0; text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { color: #0A1547; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; }

</style>
</head>
<body>
{#- 이 템플릿은 result.json 값을 표시만 한다. 합계·비율·좌표 계산 금지(CLAUDE.md 8절). -#}
<div style="background: #EEF0F5; color: #0A1547; font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; padding: 0 0 44px;">

  {#- 1. 헤더 라벨·제목·백테스트 구간 / 2. 헤더 KPI 4개 #}
  <header style="background: #0A1547; padding: 26px 44px 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
        <div style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: #7C9BFF; font-weight: 700;">{{ meta.label }}</div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #FFFFFF;">{{ meta.title }}</h1>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #98A3D2;">백테스트 구간 {{ meta.period.start }} ~ {{ meta.period.end }} · {{ meta.period.trading_days }}거래일 · {{ meta.strategy.label }} · {{ meta.universe|map(attribute="name")|join("·") }} · 생성 {{ meta.generated_at[:10] }}{% if meta.is_example %} · 예시 데이터(가짜 수치){% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
        <div style="display: flex; background: rgba(200,210,240,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(200,210,240,0.24); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
          <div style="padding: 9px 18px; font-size: 13px; color: #AEB8DE;">{{ meta.data_source.provider }} {{ meta.env }}</div>
          <div style="padding: 9px 18px; font-size: 13px; background: #1428A0; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 500;">{{ meta.strategy.params.bar_minutes }}분봉 · {{ meta.period.days }}일</div>
          <div style="padding: 9px 18px; font-size: 13px; color: #AEB8DE;">벤치마크 {{ meta.benchmark.name }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #0A1547; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;">초기 자본 {{ meta.capital|won }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 34px; flex-wrap: wrap; border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,210,240,0.2); padding-top: 20px;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px;">
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #98A3D2;">누적 수익률</div>
        <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: {{ summary.total_return_sign|sign_color_dark }};">{{ summary.total_return_pct|signed_pct }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #AEB8DE;">최종 {{ summary.final_equity|won }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px;">
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #98A3D2;">{{ meta.benchmark.name }} 대비 초과수익</div>
        <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: {{ summary.excess_return_sign|sign_color_dark }};">{{ summary.excess_return_pct|signed_pct }}p</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #AEB8DE;">{{ meta.benchmark.name }} {{ summary.benchmark_return_pct|signed_pct }} · {% if summary.excess_return_sign == "pos" %}시장 상회{% elif summary.excess_return_sign == "neg" %}시장 하회{% else %}시장과 같음{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px;">
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #98A3D2;">최대 낙폭(MDD)</div>
        <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: {{ summary.mdd_sign|sign_color_dark }};">{{ summary.mdd_pct|signed_pct }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #AEB8DE;">{% if summary.mdd_trough_date is none %}낙폭 없음{% else %}{% if summary.mdd_peak_date is none %}시작{% else %}{{ summary.mdd_peak_date }}{% endif %} → {{ summary.mdd_trough_date }}{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px;">
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #98A3D2;">거래 횟수</div>
        <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF;">{{ "{:,}".format(summary.trade_count) }}회</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #AEB8DE;">{% if flags.no_trades %}거래 없음{% else %}매수 {{ "{:,}".format(summary.buy_count) }} · 매도 {{ "{:,}".format(summary.sell_count) }}{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main style="padding: 26px 44px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">

    {#- 3. KPI 카드 5개 #}
    <section style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 18px;">
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">최종 평가금액</div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap;">{{ summary.final_equity|won }}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: {{ summary.total_return_sign|sign_color }}; font-weight: 700;">{{ summary.total_return_pct|signed_pct }}</div>
        </div>
        <svg viewBox="{{ charts.sparklines.viewbox }}" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="누적 수익률 추이" style="width: 100%; height: 44px; margin-top: auto;">
          <polyline points="{{ charts.sparklines.equity }}" fill="none" stroke="#1428A0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">실현 손익</div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap; color: {{ summary.realized_pnl_sign|sign_color }};">{{ summary.realized_pnl|signed_won }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; font-size: 12px; color: #6E7688;">
          <div style="white-space: nowrap;">비용 전 손익 <span style="color: {{ summary.gross_pnl_sign|sign_color }}; font-weight: 700;">{{ summary.gross_pnl|signed_won }}</span></div>
          <div style="white-space: nowrap;">총 비용 <span style="color: #0A1547; font-weight: 700;">{{ summary.total_cost|won }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <svg viewBox="{{ charts.sparklines.viewbox }}" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="누적 실현 손익 추이" style="width: 100%; height: 44px; margin-top: auto;">
          <polyline points="{{ charts.sparklines.realized_pnl }}" fill="none" stroke="#4B5CC0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;">
        <div style="width: 78px; height: 78px; border-radius: 50%; background: {{ charts.win_donut.conic_gradient }}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
          <div style="width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900;">{{ summary.win_rate_pct|pct }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">승률</div>
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #0A1547; font-weight: 500;">{% if flags.no_trades %}청산 없음{% else %}{{ "{:,}".format(summary.win_count) }}승 {{ "{:,}".format(summary.loss_count) }}패{% if summary.even_count %} {{ "{:,}".format(summary.even_count) }}무{% endif %}{% endif %}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #8B92A2;">청산 {{ "{:,}".format(summary.closed_count) }}건</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">평균 보유 시간</div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap;">{% if summary.avg_hold_minutes is none %}–{% else %}{{ summary.avg_hold_minutes }}분{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6E7688; white-space: nowrap;">일평균 청산 {{ summary.avg_closed_per_day }}건 · 체결 {{ summary.avg_fills_per_day }}건</div>
        <svg viewBox="{{ charts.sparklines.viewbox }}" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="일별 체결 건수 추이" style="width: 100%; height: 44px; margin-top: auto;">
          <polyline points="{{ charts.sparklines.daily_fills }}" fill="none" stroke="#7C9BFF" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">총 거래대금</div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap;">{{ summary.total_trade_value|won }}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6E7688; font-weight: 700;">{% if flags.no_trades %}거래 없음{% else %}총 거래량 {{ "{:,}".format(summary.total_trade_volume) }}주{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: flex-end; height: 44px; margin-top: auto;">
          {%- for b in charts.trade_value_bars %}
          <div title="{{ b.label }} 주 {{ b.value|won }}" style="flex: 1; height: {{ b.height_pct }}%; background: {{ b.color }}; border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0;"></div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.9fr 1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: stretch;">

      {#- 4. 자산 곡선 vs 벤치마크 #}
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
            <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">자산 곡선과 벤치마크 buy&amp;hold</div>
            <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">단위: {{ charts.equity.unit }} · {{ meta.period.start }} ~ {{ meta.period.end }}</div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;">
              <div style="width: 14px; height: 3px; background: #1428A0;"></div>
              <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6E7688;">전략</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;">
              <div style="width: 14px; height: 0; border-top: 3px dashed #98A3D2;"></div>
              <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6E7688;">{{ meta.benchmark.name }} buy&amp;hold</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr; gap: 10px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; height: 250px; font-size: 11px; color: #8B92A2;">
            {%- for v in charts.equity.y_labels %}
            <div>{{ "%.1f"|format(v) }}</div>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative; height: 250px; border-left: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9;">
            <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
              <div style="height: 1px; background: #F1F2F7;"></div>
              <div style="height: 1px; background: #F1F2F7;"></div>
              <div style="height: 1px; background: #F1F2F7;"></div>
              <div style="height: 1px; background: #F1F2F7;"></div>
              <div style="height: 1px; background: transparent;"></div>
            </div>
            <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: {{ charts.equity.zero_line_top_pct }}%; height: 1px; background: #C2C8E8;"></div>
            <svg viewBox="{{ charts.equity.viewbox }}" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="전략과 벤치마크의 누적 수익률 곡선" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 250px;">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="areaFill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#1428A0" stop-opacity="0.22"></stop>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1428A0" stop-opacity="0.02"></stop>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <path d="{{ charts.equity.equity_area_path }}" fill="url(#areaFill)"></path>
              <polyline points="{{ charts.equity.equity_points }}" fill="none" stroke="#1428A0" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>
              <polyline points="{{ charts.equity.benchmark_points }}" fill="none" stroke="#98A3D2" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="8 7"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div></div>
          <div style="position: relative; height: 26px;">
            {%- for x in charts.equity.x_labels %}
            <div style="position: absolute; top: 10px; left: {{ x.x_pct }}%; transform: translateX(-50%); font-size: 11px; color: #8B92A2; white-space: nowrap;">{{ x.label }}</div>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top: 1px solid #EEF0F5; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4A5568;">{{ charts.equity.caption }}</div>
      </div>

      {#- 5. 종목별 거래대금 비중 도넛(v2) #}
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
          <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">종목별 거래대금 비중</div>
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">매수 + 매도 체결 금액 · 전체 {{ trade_value_share.total|won }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 4px 0 8px;">
          <div role="img" aria-label="종목별 거래대금 비중 도넛" style="width: 176px; height: 176px; border-radius: 50%; background: {{ trade_value_share.conic_gradient }}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
            <div style="width: 116px; height: 116px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFFFFF; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 2px;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900;">{{ "{:,}".format(trade_value_share.center.value) }}{{ trade_value_share.center.unit }}</div>
              <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6E7688;">{{ trade_value_share.center.label }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          {%- for s in trade_value_share.segments %}
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 12px 1fr auto auto; gap: 12px; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 2px; background: {{ s.color }};"></div>
            <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #2D3A52;">{{ s.label }}</div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #8B92A2; white-space: nowrap;">{{ s.value|won }}</div>
            <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; min-width: 56px; text-align: right;">{{ s.share_pct|pct }}</div>
          </div>
          {%- else %}
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #8B92A2;">해당 없음 (체결된 매매가 없습니다)</div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: stretch;">

      {#- 6. 일별 손익 막대(v2): 위 절반 수익, 아래 절반 손실. 높이·색은 daily[].segments 그대로 #}
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; min-width: 0;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
            <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">일별 손익</div>
            <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">거래일별 실현 손익 · 막대 끝 = 최대 {{ charts.daily_pnl.max_abs|won }}</div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; flex-shrink: 0;">
            {%- for s in daily[0].segments %}
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;">
              <div style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 2px; background: {{ s.color }};"></div>
              <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #6E7688;">{{ s.label }}</div>
            </div>
            {%- endfor %}
            {%- if summary.halt_days %}
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;">
              <div style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #C98A2E;"></div>
              <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #6E7688;">매매 중단일</div>
            </div>
            {%- endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="position: relative; height: 210px;">
          <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 50%; height: 1px; background: #C2C8E8;"></div>
          <div style="position: relative; display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; height: 210px;">
            {%- for d in daily %}
            <div title="{{ d.date }} 손익 {{ d.pnl|signed_won }} · 매수 {{ d.buy_count }} · 매도 {{ d.sell_count }}{% if d.halted %} · 매매 중단{% endif %}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0;">
              <div style="height: 50%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end;">
                {%- for s in d.segments if s.key == "gain" %}
                <div style="height: {{ s.height_pct }}%; background: {{ s.color }}; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;"></div>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
              <div style="height: 50%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start;">
                {%- for s in d.segments if s.key == "loss" %}
                <div style="height: {{ s.height_pct }}%; background: {{ s.color }}; border-radius: 0 0 3px 3px;"></div>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; margin-top: -10px;">
          {%- for d in daily %}
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px; min-width: 0;">
            <div style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid {% if d.halted %}#C98A2E{% else %}transparent{% endif %};"></div>
            <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #8B92A2; white-space: nowrap; height: 14px; line-height: 14px;">{% if d.show_label %}{{ d.label }}{% endif %}</div>
          </div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: auto; border-top: 1px solid #EEF0F5; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4A5568;">{{ charts.daily_pnl.caption }}</div>
      </div>

      {#- 7. 종목별 손익 기여 상위 5 #}
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
          <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">종목별 손익 기여 상위 5</div>
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">손익 절댓값 큰 순 · 실현 손익(비용 차감) · 단위 원</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
          {%- for it in top_contributors['items'] %}
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;">
              <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #2D3A52;">{{ it.name }}</div>
              <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: {{ it.sign|sign_color }};">{{ it.pnl|signed_won }}</div>
            </div>
            <div style="height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: #F1F2F7;"><div style="width: {{ it.bar_pct }}%; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: {{ it.sign|sign_color }};"></div></div>
          </div>
          {%- else %}
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #8B92A2;">해당 없음 (거래한 종목이 없습니다)</div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: auto; border-top: 1px solid #EEF0F5; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4A5568;">{{ top_contributors.note }}</div>
      </div>

      {#- 8. 분석 요약(다크 패널) #}
      <div style="background: #0A1547; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
        <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF;">분석 요약</div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
          {%- for i in insights %}
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 26px 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: start;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #7C9BFF;">{{ i.no }}</div>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
              <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.5;">{{ i.title }}</div>
              <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #AEB8DE;">{{ i.detail }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: auto; background: rgba(124,155,255,0.14); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <div style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #98A3D2; font-weight: 700;">{{ next_action.label }}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #FFFFFF;">{{ next_action.text }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.9fr 1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: start;">

      {#- 9. 종목별 상세 테이블 #}
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
            <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">종목별 상세</div>
            <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">실현 손익 높은 순 · 거래 종목 → 거래 없음 → 제외 · 수익률은 매수금액 대비</div>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #1428A0; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap;">유니버스 {{ meta.universe|length }}종목</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 0.7fr 1.9fr 0.7fr 0.8fr 0.8fr;">
          <div style="padding: 10px 12px 10px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9;">종목</div>
          <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">거래</div>
          <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">실현손익(비용 차감)</div>
          <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">승률</div>
          <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">평균 보유</div>
          <div style="padding: 10px 0 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">수익률</div>
          {% for r in per_stock %}
          {%- set bb = "" if loop.last else " border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0F5;" %}
          <div style="padding: 12px 12px 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;{{ bb }} display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;">
            <div>{{ r.name }}</div>
            <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; color: #8B92A2;">{{ r.code }} · {{ r.status_label }}{% if r.trade_count %} · 거래대금 {{ r.trade_value|won }} · 비용 {{ r.cost|won }}{% endif %}</div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #4A5568;{{ bb }} display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; white-space: nowrap;">
            <div>{{ "{:,}".format(r.trade_count) }}회</div>
            <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #8B92A2;">청산 {{ "{:,}".format(r.closed_count) }}건</div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 12px;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
            <div style="flex: 1; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: #F1F2F7;"><div style="width: {{ r.bar_pct }}%; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: {{ r.sign|sign_color }};"></div></div>
            <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; width: 92px; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; color: {{ r.sign|sign_color }};">{% if r.trade_count %}{{ r.realized_pnl|signed_won }}{% else %}–{% endif %}</div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #4A5568;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end;">{{ r.win_rate_pct|pct }}</div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #4A5568;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; white-space: nowrap;">{% if r.avg_hold_minutes is none %}–{% else %}{{ r.avg_hold_minutes }}분{% endif %}</div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0 12px 12px; font-size: 13px; color: {{ r.sign|sign_color }}; font-weight: 700;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end;">{{ r.return_pct|signed_pct }}</div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
        {#- 10. 리스크 알림 #}
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
          <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">점검 필요</div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
            {%- if flags.only_baseline_alerts %}
            <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #4A5568;">특이 리스크 없음</div>
            {%- endif %}
            {%- for a in alerts %}
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 8px 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: start;">
              <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: {{ a.color }}; margin-top: 6px;"></div>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;">
                <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;"><span style="display: inline-block; margin-right: 6px; padding: 0 6px; border: 1px solid {{ a.color }}; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 18px; color: #0A1547; vertical-align: 1px;">{% if a.level == "warn" %}경고{% elif a.level == "info" %}참고{% else %}{{ a.level }}{% endif %}</span>{{ a.title }}</div>
                {%- if a.detail %}
                <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #8B92A2;">{{ a.detail }}</div>
                {%- elif a.date %}
                <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #8B92A2;">{{ a.date }}</div>
                {%- endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
            {%- else %}
            <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #8B92A2;">해당 없음</div>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
          {#- 진입 차단 집계(blocks) #}
          <div style="border-top: 1px solid #EEF0F5; padding-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px;">
              <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;">진입 차단 집계</div>
              <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6E7688; white-space: nowrap;">돌파 {{ "{:,}".format(blocks.breakout) }}회 · 매수 {{ "{:,}".format(blocks.entries) }}회 · 차단 {{ "{:,}".format(blocks.blocked) }}회</div>
            </div>
            {%- for b in blocks['items'] %}
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr 34px; gap: 10px; align-items: center;">
              <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #2D3A52; white-space: nowrap;">{{ b.label }}</div>
              <div style="height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: #F1F2F7;"><div style="width: {{ b.bar_pct }}%; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: #7C9BFF;"></div></div>
              <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #0A1547; font-weight: 700; text-align: right;">{{ "{:,}".format(b.count) }}</div>
            </div>
            {%- endfor %}
            <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #6E7688;">{{ blocks.caption }}</div>
          </div>
          {#- 슬리피지 고지(meta.slippage_note) #}
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 8px 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: start; background: #FBF6EE; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px;">
            <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C98A2E; margin-top: 6px;"></div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4A5568;">{{ meta.slippage_note }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        {#- 11. 목표 수익률 대비 진척 #}
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
            <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">목표 수익률 진척</div>
            <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">목표 {{ target.target_return_pct|signed_pct }} · 목표 평가금액 {{ target.target_equity|won }}</div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
            <div style="height: 14px; border-radius: 7px; background: #F1F2F7; overflow: hidden; display: flex;">
              {%- for b in target.bar_segments %}
              <div title="{{ b.label }} {{ b.width_pct|pct }}" style="width: {{ b.width_pct }}%; background: {{ b.color }};"></div>
              {%- endfor %}
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px;">
              <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: #6E7688;">진척 {{ target.progress_pct|pct }} ({% for b in target.bar_segments %}{{ b.label }} {{ b.width_pct|pct }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}){% if target.current_return_sign == "neg" %} · 수익률이 0% 아래라 진척 0%{% endif %}</div>
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #8B92A2;">현재 수익률</div>
                <div style="font-family: 'Gothic A1', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: {{ target.current_return_sign|sign_color }};">{{ target.current_return_pct|signed_pct }}</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="border-top: 1px solid #EEF0F5; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4A5568;">{{ target.caption }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {#- 12. 매매 내역 표(v2: in_table 행만, 배열 순서대로, 체결 시각 포함) #}
    <section style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E4EC; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px 28px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;">
          <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;">매매 내역</div>
          <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #6E7688;">체결 순 · 신호는 {{ meta.strategy.params.bar_minutes }}분봉 종가, 체결은 다음 봉 시가 · 비용은 매수·매도 양쪽 반영(왕복 {{ meta.costs.round_trip_pct|pct }})</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #1428A0; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap;">{% if flags.no_trades %}거래 없음{% elif trade_table.truncated %}전체 {{ "{:,}".format(trade_table.total) }}건 중 최근 {{ "{:,}".format(trade_table.shown) }}건 · 비용 합계 {{ summary.total_cost|won }}{% else %}{{ "{:,}".format(trade_table.total) }}건 · 비용 합계 {{ summary.total_cost|won }}{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 0.55fr 1.25fr 0.55fr 0.65fr 0.9fr 1.05fr 0.75fr 1.05fr 1fr;">
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px 10px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9;">체결일</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9;">시각</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9;">종목</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9;">구분</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">수량</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">체결가</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">금액</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">비용</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9; text-align: right;">실현손익</div>
        <div style="padding: 10px 0 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B92A2; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCE0E9;">사유</div>
        {% for t in trades if t.in_table %}
        {%- set bb = "" if loop.last else " border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0F5;" %}
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px 11px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4A5568;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; white-space: nowrap;">{{ t.date }}</div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A5568;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; white-space: nowrap;">{{ t.time }}</div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;{{ bb }} display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 2px;">
          <div>{{ t.name }}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; color: #8B92A2;">{{ t.code }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center;"><span style="padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; {% if t.side == "SELL" %}background: #0A1547; color: #FFFFFF;{% else %}background: #EEF0F5; color: #0A1547;{% endif %}">{{ t.side_label }}</span></div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A5568;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; white-space: nowrap;">{{ "{:,}".format(t.qty) }}주</div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A5568;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; white-space: nowrap;">{{ t.price|won }}</div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #0A1547;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; white-space: nowrap;">{{ t.amount|won }}</div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #8B92A2;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; white-space: nowrap;">{{ t.cost|won }}</div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 12px;{{ bb }} display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; white-space: nowrap;">
          <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: {{ t.sign|sign_color }};">{{ t.realized_pnl|signed_won }}</div>
          {%- if t.hold_minutes is not none %}
          <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #8B92A2;">보유 {{ t.hold_minutes }}분</div>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 11px 0 11px 12px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A5568;{{ bb }} display: flex; align-items: center;">{{ t.reason_label }}</div>
        {% else %}
        <div style="grid-column: 1 / -1; padding: 18px 0 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #8B92A2;">거래 없음 (백테스트 구간에 체결된 매매가 없습니다)</div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {%- if trade_table.caption %}
      <div style="border-top: 1px solid #EEF0F5; padding: 12px 0 6px; font-size: 12px; color: #6E7688;">{{ trade_table.caption }}</div>
      {%- endif %}
    </section>

    {#- 용어 풀이 한 줄 #}
    <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; color: #6E7688; padding: 2px 4px 0;">용어 · 최대 낙폭(MDD): 기간 중 일별 장 마감 고점 대비 가장 크게 떨어진 비율 · 초과수익(%p): 전략 수익률에서 {{ meta.benchmark.name }} 수익률을 뺀 값 · 실현 손익: 매도로 확정된 손익(비용 차감) · 비용 전 손익: 비용을 빼기 전 매매 차익 · 평균 보유 시간: 매수 체결부터 매도 체결까지의 평균 분 · buy&amp;hold: 첫날 사서 끝까지 보유 · 청산: 매수한 종목을 매도해 거래를 마침(매일 장 마감 전 전량 청산)</div>

    {#- 한계 고지(meta.disclaimers) #}
    <div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; color: #8B92A2; padding: 2px 4px 0;">{% for d in meta.disclaimers %}{{ d }}{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}{% else %}해당 없음{% endfor %}</div>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
